 "remarks": "Rare opportunity to own one of the very few true 3-bedroom, 1.5-bath ranch-style units in the complex! Beautifully remodeled with today's buyer in mind, this move-in ready home features a bright open-concept layout that seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen areas-perfect for both entertaining and everyday comfort.  The updated interior offers a modern feel while maintaining warmth and functionality, creating a space that instantly feels like home. Generous room sizes, low-maintenance living, and a rare three-bedroom configuration make this unit stand out from the rest.  Ideally located in Norwalk's desirable Strawberry Hill/Westport Avenue area, you'll enjoy easy access to shopping, restaurants, parks, Metro North, I-95, and everything both Norwalk and Westport have to offer.  Whether you're a first-time buyer, downsizing, or simply looking for a turnkey property in a convenient location, this home checks all the boxes.  Owner is actively searching for suitable housing.  A rare and beautifully updated find-don't miss your chance to make it yours!",
